#: ui/k_mnu.cpp:372
msgid ""
"<p>You have chosen to open another desktop session."
"<br>The current session will be hidden and a new login screen will be "
"displayed."
"<br>An F-key is assigned to each session; F%1 is usually assigned to the "
"first session, F%2 to the second session and so on. You can switch between "
"sessions by pressing CTRL, ALT and the appropriate F-key at the same "
"time.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du wullt noch een Schrievdischtörn opmaken. "
"<br> De aktuelle Törn warrt verstekt un een niegen Anmell-Schirm wiest. "
"<br>För jeedeen Törn gifft dat eenFunktschoons-Tast, F%1 vör'n eersten, "
"F%2 vör'n tweeten usw. Du kannst twischen de Törns mit mit Strg+Alt+F-Tast "
"wesseln.</p>"

